Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Conclusion & Future Directions", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9295225422720203`*^9, 3.929522544471014*^9}, {
  3.929522786405571*^9, 
  3.929522789225653*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"779395c3-0d1d-a649-8c1f-\
f5bbcef3b515"],

Cell["\<\
We were able to successfully generate an animation of a ball that plays music \
based on its bounces. We were also able to expand our project to include \
adjustable conditions, instruments, and number of balls. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.92962782608972*^9, 3.929627867549258*^9}, {
  3.9296283672455463`*^9, 3.929628519508215*^9}, {3.929628561369196*^9, 
  3.929628675038004*^9}, {3.9296503831590767`*^9, 3.929650405735943*^9}, {
  3.929650463713306*^9, 3.929650477621498*^9}, {3.929709339188274*^9, 
  3.929709342585911*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ff868798-0d27-ac4a-9bee-\
408358c2c0f6"],

Cell["\<\
In the future, I wish to expand my project so that it produces more \
interesting sounds. For example, I want to implement a feature where the \
balls collide in the air and produce additional sounds. This will increase \
the potential of the project to be able to generate more melodies. An idea \
that I have is to play the Super Mario Bros Theme with bouncing balls. \
Another idea that I have is that instead of balls, I could use cubes or \
tetrahedrons to play the music, with each face representing a different \
pitch. I also hope to include a feature where a user is able to import an \
audio file and the simulation will create a staircase with different-sized \
steps that replicates the melody. Finally, I hope to improve the interface of \
the animation with various colors and steps that light up when touched.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9297093448529415`*^9, {3.929709875695057*^9, 3.929709922661127*^9}, {
   3.9297099589331036`*^9, 3.929710046511631*^9}, {3.929710089371649*^9, 
   3.9297101500578766`*^9}, {3.929710207616783*^9, 3.9297102245258884`*^9}, {
   3.9297102977760315`*^9, 3.9297103103180885`*^9}, {3.9297103458925533`*^9, 
   3.9297103462003517`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"07811d0e-aacf-8b45-9b21-\
5bccab934a5f"]
}, Open  ]],

