  3.9296166319306393`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b247ef9a-3083-e448-99bc-\
5b28ffc90efb"],

Cell["\<\
I would like to thank my mentor, Carlos Angulo, for providing support \
throughout the process of coding. I would also like to thank the Wolfram High \
School Summer Research Program for granting me the resources and \
opportunities to create this project.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.929628690755199*^9, 3.929628782285745*^9}, {
